      <items code="at0000">
        <items id="text">Lens_specification</items>
        <items id="description">This archetype defines the specifications of a lens, including its type, power, and other relevant attributes. It can also be used to specify a constellation of trial lenses, if they are positioned sufficiently closely to one another to be simplified as one lens.  It is used to document lens details for glasses or contact lenses, based on observations, prescriptions, or measurements.</items>
      </items>
